{"id": "2914", "type": "page", "slug": "returns-policy", "path": "returns-policy", "title": "Returns Policy", "date": "2025-04-15 15:56:22", "modified": "2025-04-15 16:00:58", "excerpt": "", "content": "<h2>Home / </h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Hippocrates Wellness’ <br>\nOnline Store & Mail Order Return Policy\n</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Last Update: January 28, 2022</p><p>We stand behind the quality of our products sold through our website and in the store. If for some reason you are not satisfied, please find our return policy below.</p><p><strong>Returns</strong></p><p>Items may be returned within <strong>20 days</strong> of the delivery date, by mail. Returns must be unused and in the same condition that you received it in with the seal unbroken, and be accompanied with a receipt. In the event that there is no receipt, a store credit may be issued at the discretion of management. To return your product, you must obtain a manager’s approval for refund or exchange by contacting <a style=\"color: #ff6600; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"mailto:mailorder@hippocratesinst.org\">mailorder@hippocratesinst.org</a> or 877-582-5850. All refunds are processed using the same payment method as the original purchase. Shipping charges will not be refunded. Please ship your return to the address below:</p><p>Hippocrates Wellness<br />Attn: Shipping/Mail Order Department<br />1466 Hippocrates Way<br />West Palm Beach, FL 33411</p><p><strong>International orders</strong></p><p>If an international order is returned to us because it did not pass customs, the shipping charges incurred will be deducted from the refund once all products are returned to us in their original condition. Hippocrates Wellness is not responsible for any customs restriction, tariffs, or other regulations that may apply in the country of delivery. All HHI merchandize must be received to our returns department in their original condition to qualify for a refund.</p><p> </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/best-of-raw-1.jpg\" alt=\"best-of-raw\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/chamber-of-commerce-1.jpg\" alt=\"chamber-of-commerce\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hispanic-chamber-of-commerce-1.jpg\" alt=\"hispanic-chamber-of-commerce\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ispa-1.jpg\" alt=\"ispa\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/spas-of-america-1.jpg\" alt=\"spas-of-america\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/tripadivisor-1.jpg\" alt=\"tripadivisor\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/vegan-of-the-year-1.jpg\" alt=\"vegan-of-the-year\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/wellness-travel-guide-1.jpg\" alt=\"wellness-travel-guide\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/bbb-accredited-1.jpg\" alt=\"bbb-accredited\" /></figure>", "seoTitle": null, "seoDesc": null, "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": null, "terms": {}, "elementor": true, "content_live": "<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2914\" class=\"elementor elementor-2914\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-2af7fd4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2af7fd4\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-256bf3ab\" data-id=\"256bf3ab\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e6683e3 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor